\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\lang2057\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. SAVIOUR, blessed Saviour,
\par Listen while we sing;
\par Hearts and voices raising
\par Praises to our King:
\par All we have we offer,
\par All we hope to be,
\par Body, soul, and spirit,
\par All we yield to Thee.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Nearer, ever nearer,
\par Christ, we draw to Thee,
\par Deep in adoration
\par Bending low the knee.
\par Thou, for our redemption,
\par Cam'st on earth to die;
\par Thou, that we might follow,
\par Hast gone up on high.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Clearer still, and clearer,
\par Dawns the light from heaven,
\par In our sadness bringing
\par News of sin forgiving;
\par Life has lost its shadows,
\par Pure the light within;
\par Thou hast shed Thy radiance
\par On a world of sin.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. Onward, ever onward,
\par Journeying o'er the road,
\par Worn by saints before us,
\par Journeying on to God;
\par May we hasten on,
\par Backward never looking
\par Till the prize is won.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5. Higher then, and higher,
\par Bear the ransomed soul,
\par Earthly toils forgotten,
\par Saviour, to its goal;
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Where, in joys unthought-of 
\par Saints with angels sing,
\par Never weary, raising
\par Praises to their king.
\par AMEN.
\par \lang1033\f1 
\par \cf1\lang2057\ul\b\f2\fs16 
\par }

